{{!-- The system's own tools, one list row each (Primitive 7): the glyph, then the word. A row
      opens a window of its own and the menu stays open, so several can be used in a row. The
      rule under a row is drawn ink and only emitted when a row follows. --}}
<ol class="cairn-plain-list cairn-actions-list">
    <li class="cairn-slot cairn-actions-row" data-action="openWhisper" role="button">
        <span class="cairn-actions-glyph"><i class="fa-solid fa-comment-dots" inert></i></span>
        <span class="cairn-item-title">{{localize "CAIRN.Whisper.Title"}}</span>
    </li>
</ol>
